  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math> is such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.&nbsp;</p><p>Consider two statements:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></math> there exists <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math> there exists <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>, such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is decreasing in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>, increasing in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;then</p>"
  },
